WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.400
If a page gets an existing date wrong,
correct the date and show the source.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:11.000
If a court acts again later, add a new
dated entry and update the status.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.640
In both cases, a short public note lets
readers see exactly what changed.
